[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by his", "start": 0.4, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "excellency Han Zen, the Vice President", "start": 2.879, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "of the People's Republic of China.", "start": 6.96, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "I request protocol to es escort his", "start": 10.719, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 13.28, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 16.24, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President, colleagues,", "start": 46.16, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "the world is witnessing intertwined", "start": 50.16, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "changes and turbulence, protracted", "start": 53.36, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "geopolitical conflicts, widening", "start": 56.239, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "development gaps, and a growing number", "start": 59.039, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "of global challenges.", "start": 62.079, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "Five years ago, at the 76th session of", "start": 65.199, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "the UN General Assembly, President", "start": 68.88, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Xiinping put forward the global", "start": 71.119, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "development initiative.", "start": 73.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Since then he has proposed the global", "start": 75.439, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "security initiative, the global", "start": 78.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "civilization initiative and the global", "start": 80.0, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "governance initiative.", "start": 82.56, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "These initiatives provide strategic", "start": 84.96, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "guidance for the building of a community", "start": 87.439, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "with a shared future for humanity. At a", "start": 89.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "time when countries of the world find", "start": 92.4, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "their future so closely linked, more and", "start": 94.24, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "more of them want to join hands to", "start": 96.88, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "shoulder the historic mission of", "start": 99.04, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "addressing difficulties and challenges", "start": 101.28, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "and advancing the well-being of all", "start": 103.68, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "humanity.", "start": 105.759, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "With this in mind, I propose that we", "start": 107.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "take the following four steps.", "start": 109.439, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "First, we should safeguard the post-war", "start": 112.56, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "international order and foster lasting", "start": 115.28, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "peace based on common security. The", "start": 117.92, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "world wants peace, not war.", "start": 120.799, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "The international system centered on the", "start": 124.32, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "UN and", "start": 126.64, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "the international order underpinned by", "start": 131.12, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "international law that emerged after", "start": 133.92, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "World War II must be upheld.", "start": 136.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "We should turn into action the vision of", "start": 139.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "common, comprehensive, cooperative and", "start": 142.4, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "sustainable security and reject the cold", "start": 145.36, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "war mindset and block confrontation.", "start": 148.879, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "We should settle differences and", "start": 152.239, "duration": 3.041}, {"text": "disputes through dialogue and", "start": 153.76, "duration": 3.119}, {"text": "consultation", "start": 155.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "and oppose unilateral military actions", "start": 156.879, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "that violate the UN charter and", "start": 160.48, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "circumvent security council", "start": 162.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "authorization.", "start": 164.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Major countries should their special", "start": 167.12, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "responsibilities for safeguarding", "start": 169.2, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "international peace and security and", "start": 171.12, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "they should take the lead in complying", "start": 173.599, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "with the rules, upholding rule of law,", "start": 175.599, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "and doing what's right.", "start": 178.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "China holds that the sovereignty and", "start": 180.8, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "security of countries in the Middle", "start": 183.28, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "East, including the Gulf, should be", "start": 185.2, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "respected. International industrial and", "start": 187.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "supply chains should be kept stable and", "start": 190.239, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "unimpeded and global trade should be", "start": 192.56, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "safeguarded.", "start": 195.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "China calls for advancing the governance", "start": 197.04, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "of the West Bank and the postconlict", "start": 199.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "reconstruction of Gaza in accordance", "start": 202.319, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "with the principle of the Palestinians", "start": 204.959, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "governing Palestine.", "start": 206.879, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "It also calls for bringing the", "start": 208.879, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Palestinian question back onto the right", "start": 210.48, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "track of this two-state solution at an", "start": 212.879, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "early date", "start": 215.04, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "on Ukraine.", "start": 216.799, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "President Xiinping has put forward four", "start": 218.4, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "points on what must be done which are", "start": 220.799, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "the fundamental guidance for China in", "start": 224.48, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "playing a continued constructive role in", "start": 227.36, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "its own way for achieving a political", "start": 230.159, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "settlement of the crisis.", "start": 232.4, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "China urges the relevant country to", "start": 235.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "immediately stop using threat of force", "start": 238.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "against Cuba and immediately and", "start": 240.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "completely lift the blockade and", "start": 242.72, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "sanctions against Cuba.", "start": 244.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Second, we should address the global", "start": 248.319, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "development predicament", "start": 250.72, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "and promote prosperity for all through", "start": 252.879, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "openness and cooperation.", "start": 255.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "We should keep development at the center", "start": 258.0, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "of the international agenda and jointly", "start": 260.079, "duration": 6.001}, {"text": "forge a global development partnership", "start": 263.28, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "based on unity and equality and that is", "start": 266.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "balanced and inclusive.", "start": 268.639, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "It is important to give priority to key", "start": 271.28, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "areas including poverty reduction, food", "start": 273.84, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "security and energy transition. Step up", "start": 276.96, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "resource input and increase support for", "start": 279.919, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "countries in the global south.", "start": 282.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Developed countries should honor their", "start": 285.759, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "commitment to development financing and", "start": 288.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "climate financing.", "start": 290.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "The international community should also", "start": 293.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "build consensus and pull strength to", "start": 296.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "formulate the post2030 global", "start": 299.6, "duration": 5.879}, {"text": "development agenda.", "start": 301.919, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "Facing a new scientific and", "start": 306.0, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "technological revolution and industrial", "start": 307.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "transformation, especially the dynamic", "start": 309.84, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "development of artificial intelligence,", "start": 312.4, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "we should take a people- centered", "start": 315.52, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "approach and develop AI for the positive", "start": 317.199, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "and for good.", "start": 319.52, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "narrow the digital divide and promote", "start": 321.6, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "development that is universally", "start": 324.16, "duration": 4.759}, {"text": "beneficial.", "start": 325.919, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Both history and reality prove that", "start": 329.759, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "countries can hardly achieve development", "start": 332.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "without an open and cooperative", "start": 335.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "international environment.", "start": 337.28, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Protectionism produces no winners.", "start": 340.0, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Building walls, erecting barriers,", "start": 342.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "decoupling and cutting off supply", "start": 345.52, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "chains, disrupt global industrial and", "start": 347.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "supply chains and harm the interests of", "start": 350.479, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "all parties.", "start": 352.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "We must firmly safeguard the WTO", "start": 355.28, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "centered rules-based multilateral", "start": 358.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "trading system,", "start": 360.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": ">> build an open world economy,", "start": 363.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "jointly foster and strengthen new growth", "start": 366.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "drivers and see that economic", "start": 369.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "globalization is inclusive and delivers", "start": 372.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "benefits to all.", "start": 375.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Third, we should advance exchanges and", "start": 378.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "mutual learning among civilizations and", "start": 380.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "rebuild unity and mutual trust through", "start": 383.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "communication and dialogue.", "start": 385.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Diversity has created splendor in the", "start": 388.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "world. Condescension and the", "start": 391.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "self-centered mindset have no place in", "start": 394.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "the interactions among different", "start": 396.56, "duration": 3.359}, {"text": "cultures.", "start": 398.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Promoting mutual trust, mutual respect,", "start": 399.919, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "solidarity, and harmonious coexistence", "start": 402.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "is the right approach to take.", "start": 405.199, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "We need to use the UN platform to boost", "start": 408.16, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "international people-to-people exchanges", "start": 410.639, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "and take the celebration of the", "start": 413.759, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "international day for dialogue among", "start": 415.52, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "civilizations as an occasion to promote", "start": 417.28, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "mutual understanding and amity among all", "start": 420.0, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "peoples and the common development of", "start": 422.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "diverse civilizations.", "start": 424.479, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "We should reject ideological prejudice", "start": 426.72, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "and respect the development path and", "start": 429.039, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "social systems decided on independently", "start": 430.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "by the people of all countries. We", "start": 433.12, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "should deepen the sharing of governance", "start": 435.44, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "practices and jointly explore ways to", "start": 437.12, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "tackle challenges facing our times.", "start": 439.919, "duration": 4.521}, {"text": "Fourth, we should stay committed to", "start": 445.199, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "multilateralism and take steps to", "start": 447.84, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "safeguard fairness and justice.", "start": 450.639, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Multilateralism is a choice made by", "start": 453.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "humanity after going through scourges", "start": 456.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "and fairness and justice are the joint", "start": 460.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "pursuit of the people of all countries.", "start": 462.479, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "China holds that all countries, big or", "start": 465.36, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "small, are equal members of the", "start": 467.759, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "international community and that world", "start": 469.759, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "affairs should be handled by all through", "start": 472.639, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "consultation", "start": 475.44, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "and rule of law, fairness and justice in", "start": 477.199, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "international affairs should be jointly", "start": 480.479, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "upheld.", "start": 482.479, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Countries should join forces and act", "start": 484.4, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "together to safeguard the UN and make it", "start": 486.479, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "stronger.", "start": 489.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "China supports the UN in reforming and", "start": 492.16, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "improving itself. It should advance the", "start": 494.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "UN80 initiative and enhance the", "start": 497.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "performance of its bodies rather than", "start": 500.08, "duration": 7.16}, {"text": "merely cut its budgets and mandates.", "start": 502.72, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "It should effectively address global", "start": 508.879, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "challenges including climate change and", "start": 511.599, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "public health security,", "start": 514.479, "duration": 5.161}, {"text": "improve", "start": 516.64, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "and increase the representation and", "start": 519.68, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "voice of the global south.", "start": 521.36, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "China pays high tribute to Secretary", "start": 526.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "General Antonio Gutish who will complete", "start": 528.959, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "his term soon. China supports the", "start": 531.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "election in accordance with the UN", "start": 534.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "charter of a new secretary general who", "start": 535.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "honors the UN charter, has exceptional", "start": 539.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "capability, upholds integrity and", "start": 541.68, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "fairness, and demonstrates courage and", "start": 544.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "dedication.", "start": 546.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Mr. President, colleagues,", "start": 548.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "on October 25th, 1971,", "start": 551.12, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "right here in this August hall, the", "start": 554.88, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "General Assembly adopted resolution 2758", "start": 557.839, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "at its 26th session with an overwhelming", "start": 562.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "majority by which ANA decided to restore", "start": 564.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "all the rights of the people's republic", "start": 568.8, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "of China in the UN and recognized the", "start": 570.8, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "representatives of the government of the", "start": 573.279, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "people's republic of China as the only", "start": 575.2, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "legitimate repres representatives of", "start": 577.6, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "China to the UN. This is of profound and", "start": 579.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "far-reaching significance for both China", "start": 582.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and the world.", "start": 585.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Over the past 55 years,", "start": 588.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "China has been the stabilizing force in", "start": 591.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "times of volatility. China is firmly", "start": 593.68, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "committed to pursuing peaceful", "start": 596.56, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "development and has the best track", "start": 598.16, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "record on peace and security among major", "start": 600.56, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "countries.", "start": 602.88, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "It is the largest contributor to", "start": 604.959, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "peacekeepers among the permanent members", "start": 606.64, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "of the UN security council. It also took", "start": 609.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "the initiative that led to the issuance", "start": 612.32, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "of the first joint statement of the", "start": 614.88, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "leaders of the five nuclear weapon", "start": 616.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "states on preventing nuclear war. China", "start": 618.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "has been a main engine driving common", "start": 621.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "development. China has created two", "start": 624.64, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "miracles at home, namely fast economic", "start": 627.519, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "roles and long-term social stability.", "start": 629.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and over many years it has contributed", "start": 632.56, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "around 30% to global growth.", "start": 635.44, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "China has joined hands with more than", "start": 640.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "three4 of the countries in the world in", "start": 643.36, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "pursuing highquality belt and road", "start": 645.92, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 647.839, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "It has mobilized over 23 billion US", "start": 650.32, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "dollars and carried out more than 2,000", "start": 654.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "projects under the global development", "start": 657.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "initiative. and it has granted zero", "start": 659.839, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "tariff status to all the African", "start": 662.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "countries and LDC's having diplomatic", "start": 664.959, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "relations with it to empower the global", "start": 667.2, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "south in pursuing modernization.", "start": 669.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "China has been a progressive force in an", "start": 673.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "era of change. China has always spoken", "start": 675.92, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "up", "start": 679.2, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "for the global south, stood up for the", "start": 680.88, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "legitimate rights and interests of", "start": 683.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "developing countries and continued to", "start": 685.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "work toward a more just and equitable", "start": 688.32, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "global governance system.", "start": 691.36, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "In October,", "start": 695.36, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "China will host the global governance", "start": 697.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "forum in the Shingan new area.", "start": 700.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "You're welcome to attend the forum and", "start": 703.68, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "join in the discussion about the way", "start": 705.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "forward in global governance.", "start": 707.92, "duration": 7.479}, {"text": "Mr. President, colleagues,", "start": 711.36, "duration": 4.039}, {"text": "no matter how the international dynamics", "start": 715.519, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "evolve,", "start": 717.519, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "China remains unchanged in its pursuit", "start": 719.279, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "of peace and development, in its", "start": 721.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "dedication to safeguarding fairness and", "start": 724.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "justice, and in its commitment to", "start": 726.56, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "multilateralism.", "start": 729.839, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "China will join hands with all other", "start": 732.399, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "countries", "start": 734.56, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "to build a community with a shared", "start": 736.16, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "future for humanity", "start": 738.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and make the world a better place for", "start": 740.959, "duration": 7.721}, {"text": "all of us. Thank you.", "start": 744.0, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 759.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "thank the vice president of the People's", "start": 762.639, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "Republic of China,", "start": 765.36, "duration": 3.719}]